ef.'","ABSENCE: no AC or step covers the ref being absent from the local view; merge-base --is-ancestor against a non-existent ref errors rather than returning false"],"finding":"The plan does not state behavior when the configured remote-tracking tickets ref (refs/remotes/<sync.remote>/<tracker.branch>) does not exist in the local view (e.g. never fetched, or misconfigured remote/branch). This is distinct from the covered 'reachable but old/new' and 'not reachable' cases, all of which assume the ref exists; a missing ref would make rev-parse/merge-base fail rather than cleanly return not-eligible.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f27c5cc5086d40b66","impact":0.33,"is_primary":null,"location":"Implementation plan step 1 & 4; Acceptance Criteria (reachability cases)","norm_id":"n8266a6a508808875","priority":0.165,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Specify that a missing/unresolvable remote-tracking tickets ref yields false (not eligible) as a safe default, and add an integration node covering an absent ref.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.5,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"na","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"no","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"easy","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","va